#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:5
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "矩形"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:8
msgid "Create rectangle"
msgstr "创建矩形"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:10
msgid "The rectangle can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "矩形只能从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 加入 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:12
msgid "Select the icon |icon_rectangle| from `toolbar`_ to add a rectangle."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_rectangle| 添加矩形 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:16
msgid "icon_rectangle"
msgstr "图标( R)"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:13
msgid "Click on the initial vertex from the rectangle in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中矩形的初始顶点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:14
msgid "Click on the end vertex from the rectangle in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中矩形的顶点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:20
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:23
msgid "Rectangle properties"
msgstr "矩形属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:25
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "元素部分属性可以在选择该部分时从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:30
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr "如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 信息** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:35
#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:75
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech rectangle part from element"
msgstr "图：元素的 QElectroTech 矩形部分"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:37
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different rectangle properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的矩形属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:43
msgid ""
"The outline and filling color of the part can be defined from a list of pre-"
"defined colors."
msgstr "部分的轮廓和填充颜色可以从预定义的颜色列表中定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:48
msgid ""
"The type of outline representation can be chosen between: Normal "
"(Continuous), Dashed, Dotted or, Dots and dashes."
msgstr "大纲表达式的类型可以在：正常(连续), Dashed, Dotted 或，Dots 和 dustes 之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:53
msgid ""
"The outline thickness (Weight) can be chosen between: None, Thin, Normal, "
"Strong or High."
msgstr "轮廓厚度(重量)可以在：无，细，正常，强或高之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "几何"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:60
msgid "The upper left vertices coordinates (x, y) can be defined."
msgstr "左上角的顶点坐标(x,y)可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst
msgid "Dimensions"
msgstr "尺寸"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:64
msgid ""
"The width and the height of the rectangle can be defined. The tangent point "
"at the vertical and horizontal edges can also be defined at the case that a "
"round vertex is desired."
msgstr "长方形的宽度和高度可以定义。垂直和水平边缘的切点也可以在需要圆顶时定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:68
msgid "Rounding rectangle vertices"
msgstr "圆形矩形顶点"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:70
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows rounding the rectangle vertices from `information "
"panel`_ or `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 或 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ "
"对矩形顶点进行四舍五入。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:78
msgid "Rounding rectangle vertices from information panel"
msgstr "从信息面板圆形矩形顶点"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:80
msgid ""
"Select the rectangle to display the rectangle properties at `information "
"panel`_."
msgstr "选择在 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示矩形属性的矩形 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:81
msgid ""
"Define the distance between the vertices and the intersection point at the "
"vertical edges."
msgstr "定义垂直边缘的顶点和交叉点之间的距离。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:82
msgid ""
"Define the distance between the vertices and the intersection point at the "
"horizontal edges."
msgstr "定义顶点和横向边缘的交叉点之间的距离。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:83
msgid "Press intro."
msgstr "按进士出身。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:84
#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Select none** from **Edit** menu or use ``Ctrl + Shift + a`` keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr "**从** 选择无 **Edit** 菜单或使用 ``Ctrl + Shift + a`` 键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:87
msgid "Rounding rectangle vertices from workspace"
msgstr "从工作空间圆形矩形顶点"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:89
msgid ""
"Select the rectangle drawn at `workspace`_. The rectangle outlines change to"
" red color and the vertices and middle edge point to blue."
msgstr "选择在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 绘制的矩形。矩形勾画为红色，顶点和中边缘点为蓝色。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:90
msgid ""
"Select the rectangle again. The outlines continue in red and the points "
"change to green color."
msgstr "再次选择矩形。 轮廓以红色继续，点改为绿色 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:91
msgid ""
"Select the rectangle for third time. The outlines continue in red and only "
"one vertex is displayed, the color is pink."
msgstr "第三次选择矩形。 轮廓以红色继续，只显示一个顶点，颜色为粉红色 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/rectangle.rst:92
msgid "Displace the pink points around the horizontal and vertical edge."
msgstr "将横向和纵向边缘周围的粉红色点移位。"
